(e
) Services that may be covered by an MCO, PIHP, or PAHP.
 An MCO, PIHP, or PAHP may cover, for enrollees, services that are not covered under the State plan in accordance with §§ 438.3(e) and 438.16(b), (d), and (e) of this chapter, except that references to § 438.7, IMDs, and rate certifications do not apply and that references to enrollee rights and protections under part 438 should be read to refer to the rights and protections under subparts K and L of this part.
